[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Simple Git
GenericName=Git client
GenericName[fr]=Client Git
Comment=Use Git without knowing Git: changes, branches, send and get
Comment[fr]=Utiliser Git sans connaître Git : modifications, branches, envoyer et récupérer
Exec=simple-git-gui %f
